  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added cell-wise == and != operators for Boolean, integer, and floating-point hex maps, including scalar comparisons, mixed numeric pairs, spatial pairs, and spatial/non-spatial pairs. Equality operators return new mutable Boolean mask maps, while spatial variants preserve geometry. Improved invalid-layout and argument diagnostics for raster and QRS APIs, and expanded map, chromatization, and raster documentation. Migration note: use is null or is not null instead of == null or != null with concrete specialized map types because equality operators now produce masks. The minimum Akeldov.Math.Spatial2D dependency remains 1.1.0, with compatible 1.x releases accepted.",
